id: pm-context-github-356cb2a080ed-136
title: Dependency projection relabels non-ordering relationships as depends_on and reverses blocks
description: "GH issue #136: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/issues/136 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-11T10:07:01Z · updated 2026-10-11T10:07:01Z"
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
